        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG441-630  Contemporary Square  Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very contemporary designed door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish for a truly eye catching design. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/jordan-leverset-with-square-rose-ahi-sig123-204\"><b>Contemporary Square Stainless Door Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-finish-11432.jpg?v=1704354729\" width=\"400\" height=\"375\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG441 Contemporary Door Pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG441 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Height: 420 mm (16.53\")</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 350 mm (13.78\") C/C</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 60 mm (2.36\")</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 24 mm (1.00\") Square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Square Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "AHI SIG441-630 - This very contemporary designed door pull is made of solid stainless steel by AHI Hardware, a leader in stainless door hardware. Warm Satin Stainless Steel finish for a truly eye catching design. Packaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (Bolts through the door). Optional  Back to Back mounting available/",
